1003                  (     newbasic.asm):00033         ENDFLG    RMB  1              STOP/END FLAG: POSITIVE=STOP, NEG=END 
1004                  (     newbasic.asm):00034         CHARAC    RMB  1              TERMINATOR FLAG 1 
1005                  (     newbasic.asm):00035         ENDCHR    RMB  1              TERMINATOR FLAG 2 
1006                  (     newbasic.asm):00036         TMPLOC    RMB  1              SCRATCH VARIABLE 
1007                  (     newbasic.asm):00037         IFCTR     RMB  1              IF COUNTER - HOW MANY IF STATEMENTS IN A LINE 
