1009                  (     newbasic.asm):00039         VALTYP    RMB  1              *DV* *PV TYPE FLAG: 0=NUMERIC, $FF=STRING 
100A                  (     newbasic.asm):00040         GARBFL    RMB  1              *TV STRING SPACE HOUSEKEEPING FLAG 
100B                  (     newbasic.asm):00041         ARYDIS    RMB  1              DISABLE ARRAY SEARCH: 00=ALLOW SEARCH 
100C                  (     newbasic.asm):00042         INPFLG    RMB  1              *TV INPUT FLAG: READ=0, INPUT<>0 
100D                  (     newbasic.asm):00043         RELFLG    RMB  1              *TV RELATIONAL OPERATOR FLAG 
100E                  (     newbasic.asm):00044         TEMPPT    RMB  2              *PV TEMPORARY STRING STACK POINTER 
