9545 B7100B           (     newbasic.asm):01003                   STA  ARYDIS         * DO NOT ALLOW THE INDEX VARIABLE TO BE AN ARRAY 
9548 BD97E3           (     newbasic.asm):01004                   JSR  LET            SET INDEX VARIABLE TO INITIAL VALUE 
954B BD93DE           (     newbasic.asm):01005                   JSR  LABF9          SEARCH THE STACK FOR ‘FOR/NEXT’ DATA 
954E 3262             (     newbasic.asm):01006                   LEAS 2,S            PURGE RETURN ADDRESS OFF OF THE STACK 
