                      (     newbasic.asm):03933         ; EXP ( E**X)                      
                      (     newbasic.asm):03934         ; THE EXPONENTIAL FUNCTION IS EVALUATED BY FIRST MULTIPLYING THE                      
                      (     newbasic.asm):03935         ; ARGUMENT BY A CORRECTION FACTOR (CF). AFTER THIS IS DONE, AN                      
